SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The uulliimmiitt() function conforms to IEEE Std 1003.1-2001 (“POSIX.1”).

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The uulliimmiitt() function first appeared in FreeBSD 5.0.

BBUUGGSS
     The uulliimmiitt() function provides limited precision for setting and retriev‐
     ing process limits.  If there is a need for greater precision than the
     type _l_o_n_g provides, the getrlimit(2) and setrlimit(2) functions should be
     considered.

